    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Project: G-ASTRO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax, explore, discover! Gather materials and upgrade yourself to traverse this new, vast land. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >G-ASTRO is a single-player exploration game where you uncover the mystery of this new world. Play as a hyperintelligent, intergalactic, space <strong>Snail</strong> and determine if the Planet suits Gastropod-kind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >G-ASTRO offers new, unique creatures to scan, observe, and interact with, a unique crafting system, and thrilling movement mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602060/extras/9220049cd35ec5c0e6a46c2e21b0e9e2.avif?t=1748590470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have Fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602060/extras/984bb37007edf4221412c15db3614fdf.avif?t=1748590470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Project: G-ASTRO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax, explore, discover! Gather materials and upgrade yourself to traverse this new, vast land. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >G-ASTRO is a single-player exploration game where you uncover the mystery of this new world. Play as a hyperintelligent, intergalactic, space <strong>Snail</strong> and determine if the Planet suits Gastropod-kind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >G-ASTRO offers new, unique creatures to scan, observe, and interact with, a unique crafting system, and thrilling movement mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602060/extras/9220049cd35ec5c0e6a46c2e21b0e9e2.avif?t=1748590470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have Fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602060/extras/984bb37007edf4221412c15db3614fdf.avif?t=1748590470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
